The canonical working guide for this repository is `CLAUDE.MD` at the root. Read
it before substantive work.

`DESIGN.md` is the binding UI spec. Read it before any work on `templates/`,
CSS, or user-facing copy.

Task-specific guidance lives in `.claude/skills/` (`sitts-ui`, `sitts-verify`,
`sitts-audesp`, `sitts-deploy`, `sitts-known-bugs`). Load the one that matches
what you're doing.

This file is a pointer on purpose — it used to duplicate `CLAUDE.MD`'s
authority and voice sections, which then drifted. Add durable conventions to
`CLAUDE.MD`, not here.
